력한 부스트를 발동하고, 가장 어려운 웨이브도 돌파하세요. 이것이 진짜 몬스터 생존입니다 — 오래 버틸수록 액션은 더 치열해지고, 매 플레이가 새로운 도전이 됩니다. 빠른 판단과 강력한 무기가 승부를 결정합니다.\n\n플레이 방법:\n– 무기 제작 — 부품을 합성해 업그레이드\n– 아이템 장비 — 부스트를 활성화해 영웅 강화\n– 쏘고 살아남기 — 몬스터의 무리에 도전\n– 강화 후 반복 — 플레이마다 강해져 궁극의 영웅으로\n\n슈팅을 좋아하고, 창의적인 무기 게임을 즐기며, 빠르고 몰입감 있는 생존 경험을 찾는 플레이어라면 Gun Hero가 제격입니다. 시작은 쉽고, 마스터하기는 어렵지만 언제나 액션으로 가득합니다 — 고양이 영웅을 위한 궁극의 생존 배틀입니다.\n \n\nMonthly Privilege Subscription\n\nSubscribe to the Monthly Privilege and unlock exclusive in-game benefits:\n\n- Battle x2 Speed\n- Additional Daily Rewards\n- Battle Pass x2 XP\n\nThe Monthly Privilege subscription costs $9.99 USD per month.\n\nPayment will be charged to your iTunes Account at confirmation of purchase.\n\nYou will receive all Monthly Privilege benefits for the duration of the subscription.\n\nYour subscription automatically renews for the same price and duration as the original one-month package unless auto-renew is turned off at least 24 hours before the end of the current period.\n\nYour account will be charged for renewal within 24 hours prior to the end of the current period at the cost of the selected package.\n\nSubscriptions may be managed by the user, and auto-renewal may be turned off in the iTunes Account Settings after purchase.\n\nNo cancellation of the current subscription is allowed during the active subscription period.\n\nYou may cancel a subscription during its free trial period via the subscription settings in your iTunes account. This must be done at least 24 hours before the end of the trial period to avoid being charged. For more information, please visit http://support.apple.com/kb/ht4098.\n\nTurning off auto-renewal is also available in your iTunes Account Settings. However, the current subscription cannot be canceled during its active period.\n\nAny unused portion of a free trial period will be forfeited when the user purchases a Monthly Privilege subscription.\n\nLinks to our Terms of Service and Privacy Policy:\n\nhttps://freeplay.io/games/ios/terms/\nhttps://freeplay.io/games/ios/privacy/", "trackCensoredName": "Gun Hero ― 2D 총 로그라이트 슈팅게임", "trackViewUrl": "https://apps.apple.com/kr/app/gun-hero-2d-%EC%B4%9D-%EB%A1%9C%EA%B7%B8%EB%9D%BC%EC%9D%B4%ED%8A%B8-%EC%8A%88%ED%8C%85%EA%B2%8C%EC%9E%84/id6751321179?uo=4", "contentAdvisoryRating": "12+", "minimumOsVersion": "13.0", "averageUserRating": 3.76707, "genres": ["게임", "엔터테인먼트", "캐주얼", "액션"], "userRatingCount": 498}]}